WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
Treasure Island

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.080
<i>I've cut the moorings on the Hispaniola.</i>

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:12.880
<i>I had hoped that <i>the Hispaniola would drift...</i></i>

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.910
<i>...so its cannons wouldn't be able to reach the fort anymore.</i>

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.960
<i>But the ship only drifted a little...</i>

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.610
<i>...and ran aground on the shallows.</i>

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:24.790
<i>My plan had failed.</i>

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.580
<i>Once on board, I thought I was in hell.</i>

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.600
<i>On this foggy night,</i>

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.080
<i>Silver's men and Hands...</i>

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.840
<i>...fought before my eyes and in the end, they killed each other.</i>

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>And then...
And then...</i>

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:53.820
<i>And then...!</i>

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.130
<i>Another demon suddenly appeared in this hell!</i>

