00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:40.310
episode

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:40.310
Hands is Supposed
\h            to be Dead

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.500
What happened to you, Jim?
You alright?

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.180
Come on now...

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.980
It's been a long time...
Won't you say hello?

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.440
Well, if you don't want to,
it doesn't matter.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:40.740
More importantly, what are you doing here?

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.290
Well?

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:06.960
Hands!

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:14.980
Did you do this, Jim?!

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.320
I asked if it was you!

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:22.700
Your men have gone mad!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.930
They lost their minds
and killed each other.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:30.330
Pirates don't need anyone to do that for them.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:33.770
After all, you pirates are all
completely mad to begin with!

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:35.060
Aren't you?!

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:43.940
I see.
So I, too, am mad?

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:48.680
Yes, you're the worst one of all!

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.310
Big jerk!

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.130
The ship has drifted!

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:08.840
Strange, the ship should still be anchored.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.310
It takes more than that to make us drift.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:15.270
I've cut the moorings, both of them!

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:16.630
You did what?!

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:21.210
Now you can't fire the cannon at the fort!

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:23.010
I see...

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:24.650
So that's why.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.110
Take that!
That'll teach you!

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:34.710
I won't let y—

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:39.720
You're an idiot, Jim.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:43.590
Who are you calling an idiot?

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:47.170
Unless you can get more cannons,
you no longer have the advantage!

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:50.430
Imbecile, I'm not talking about that!

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:55.730
With the way the ship's drifting, we're going to end up in the middle of the ocean.

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.980
With little provisions on board,

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:00.520
we could die of hunger or thirst.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:03.520
I doubt we could hold out that long, though.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:06.320
We'd probably sink before that happens!

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.930
On such a big ship without a crew, Jim,

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:14.070
the two of us would never be able to manage!

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:17.290
We'd have to raise and lower the sails.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.200
Determine the wind direction.
The depth.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.960
I'm a skilled sailor, but our chances are slim!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.970
All I can do in this situation...

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:33.260
...is try to steer away from the worst waves!

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:52.740
Damn!

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.280
Silver! Silver!

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:11.800
Starboard, Jim!
Helm to starboard!

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:36.860
Go on!

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:48.290
Jim, are you afraid to die?

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.760
I'm not afraid!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.750
Really?
You're brave.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:57.300
But I must confess, I'm afraid.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:04.450
So you really aren't afraid?
I see, you're quite the man...

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:11.230
Hey Flint, you're gonna laugh. He said he's not afraid to die.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.870
Well now, I'm going to take the helm, Jim.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:23.150
Don't worry.
I'll get us out of this storm.

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:25.210
I haven't said my last word!

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.030
Jim!

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:36.400
Go check the hold for any leaks!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:43.390
Do you really want to die?!
Hurry up!

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.400
Aye-aye, sir!

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:26.300
<i>The nerve of him...
I have no intention of dying!</i>

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:56.590
Fifteen men...

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:00.670
...on a dead man's chest.

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:04.740
Yo-ho-ho!
...and a bottle of rum!

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:11.230
Dammit, take this!
And this! And this! And this!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.150
Take this!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:18.070
Yo-ho-ho!
...and a bottle of rum!

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:20.720
Drink and the devil...

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:25.190
...had done for the rest!

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:27.710
Yo-ho-ho!

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:30.200
...and a bottle of rum!

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:38.870
Fifteen men on a dead man's chest...

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:44.180
Yo-ho-ho!
...and a bottle of rum!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.460
Silver!

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:18.880
Silver!

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:21.670
Silver!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:24.890
Silver!
This is bad!

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:29.930
There's water coming in
by the barrels in the hold!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.270
You have to come!
I can't do anything!

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:34.230
Okay, I'm coming!

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:52.090
Come on!
It's over here, Silver!

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:34.750
Mission accomplished.
I've stopped the leak.

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:44.880
Jim, my crutch.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:51.850
My crutch, if you please, Jim Hawkins.

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.290
Jim, want some?

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:17.290
You must be thirsty with all
the sea water you've swallowed.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.550
No thanks.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:20.830
I see...

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:35.250
Look, this is were the two of us peeled potatoes.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:38.730
Tell me Jim, what was your favourite meal?

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.560
My beef stew or my shish kebabs?

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:50.530
If, by chance, we somehow live through this storm,

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:53.450
I will make you your favourite meal.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.490
What d'ya say?

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:00.960
I won't eat something
made by a murderer!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.970
You killed old Redruth and Joyce!

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:15.810
You're a murderer,
a pirate and a traitor!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.690
I won't let myself be fooled again!

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:21.680
You can make me all the soup you want,
I won't be fooled by you again!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.730
You're no longer...

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.010
...my... my...!

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.900
my, my...

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:30.780
...friend John Silver.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.430
It's the island!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:40.080
I see.
I thought we had drifted away,

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:43.700
but in fact, we've just gone around the island.

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:53.280
You're still alive, huh?

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:59.120
I sent you to the other world
and now you've come back.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.920
That's not very smart, Red Hat.

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:06.790
I-I'm not Red Hat!

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:11.160
Don't worry, Red Hat,
I'll soothe your pain shortly!

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:27.980
Stop, Hands.
Leave Jim alone!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:33.600
Oh, Lean Dog!
You're still alive, too?

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:44.050
Come on, Hands.
Wake up!

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:45.540
It's me, Silver!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.910
I thought you were dead, old friend.

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:50.530
I'm so happy, Hands!

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:52.720
We've been friends for so long.

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:57.410
Come on, we're gonna take care of you.

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.920
Where are you hurt?
Your shoulder, your back?

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:02.390
S-Stay back, demon!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:17.070
I won't let you send me to hell.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.090
Poor guy...

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:21.030
He's lost his mind.

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.410
Don't blame me, Hands.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.760
Y-You dirty...!

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:44.100
DIE!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.710
Silver!

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.800
Silver!

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.780
Silver! Silver!

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.280
Silver! Silver! Silver!

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:32.190
Silver! Silver! Silver!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.210
Silver!

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:35.610
SILVER!

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:45.000
SILVER!

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.580
Silver...

