00:23:19.300 --> 00:23:24.800
The sunset on my back

00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:30.690
kamome wo kata ni tomarasete

00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:30.690
And a seagull perched on my shoulder

00:23:30.690 --> 00:23:40.410
boku wa fukimasu kuchibue wo

00:23:30.690 --> 00:23:40.410
I blow out a whistle

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:49.010
Silver, you idiot!
Why did you die like that, why?!

00:23:49.010 --> 00:23:50.840
No, it's impossible!

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:54.780
One way or another, I took back
the ship from those damn pirates!

00:23:54.780 --> 00:23:57.020
I must tell the others right away!

00:23:57.580 --> 00:24:00.330
However, when I return to the fort,

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.910
I'm greeted by a strange
noise and screams.

